; Recipe Book — "Lyra's Warband Pages"
; The second folio Lyra adds to the player's pressed-leaf book, given after a
; full warband pelt-and-fang run. Birch paper, marshmint-dyed cord, four pages.
; Discoverable: dropped in herb-shed inventory after the first cured-pelt batch (4 pelts).

